{
 "_doc": "What tools/bake-icons.mjs bakes (stream C, PLAN \u00a716). Units and heroes come from data/units.json and data/looks.json automatically; skills from data/heroes.json (`sprite` here picks the assets/data/fx sprite, else the element default). `items` are generic shop/drop bases by look: `held`/`offhand` are Chibi 2 part ids built on their own, `armour` dresses the warrior in `part` and frames it, `glyph` is a 2D flask/ring/amulet/scroll. The bake writes assets/icons/<kind>/<id>.png and assets/icons/index.json. `powerSprites.<power id>` = [fx sprite, element] for the Sanctum's powers (kind `power`, framed in `powerFrames[kind]`). Kind `building` = every town building + Keep for every race (`<race>.<kind>`). `hvf` (Hunters vs Farmers): kind `hvf-unit` (farmer/hunter/ghost + the animals, army and pets), `hvf-item` (data/hvf/hunter-items.json ids: `creature` = a creature spec, `object` = an hvf-structures kind, `role` armour = dressed on that role), `hvf-building` (every hvf-structures kind).",
